 encounters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672520/extras/5_bossfight_new.gif?t=1746032128\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show your skills in epic boss fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672520/extras/storepage_separator.png?t=1746032128\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Versebound features a brilliant score by notable dungeon synth artist Elyvilon as well as hundreds of verses from John Crawford's 1888 translation of Kalevala to immerse you in the finno-karelian iron age setting and folklore.</p>","developers":["Conifer Digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672520/header.jpg?t=1746032128","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13 and up<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel / AMD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Sound Blaster AWE32</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132600,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132600/movie480.mp4?t=1746032123","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132600/movie_max.mp4?t=1746032123"},"name":"Versebound Official Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132600/9ad5154d46769f6e15d5f7d538fe7b2aa898b013/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746032123","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2